- **Intermediate Deviations**: For positions between -0.3 and -0.1 or 0.1 and 0.3, the actions are set to 0.7 and -0.7 respectively, with an additional adjustment based on velocity.

These changes should help the car move more effectively when it is far from the center and make smaller adjustments when it is closer to the center. This dynamic response should improve the overall performance of the system in balancing the pole.
